WEBVTT

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.660
Hold! Hold the line!

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:14.990
Help me!

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.910
The ruins that Lady Belza seeks are close!

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:20.420
Put your lives on the line! Fight!

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.210
How pathetic...

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.300
We are Belza's Bodyguards,
the strongest warriors...

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:35.560
Stay focused!

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.820
Did we rescue all the Bodyguards?

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.900
Fall back to the fourth floor!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:52.740
Everyone, start retreating!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.540
No, stop! We can't go back
without accomplishing anything!

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:07.210
All of you, assist me, Alus Vi Alstein,
leader of Belza's Bodyguards!

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.130
You spoiled brat!

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:12.340
If you want something,
don't rely on others!

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.430
Cut open a path by yourself!

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.680
Rushing in head-first and
not learning from your failures,

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.520
you're the lowest of the low,
a total loser!

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.440
Y-You... How dare you...

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:25.900
But...

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:30.030
It's admirable how you're always
motivated to push forward.

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:38.370
Let's celebrate our new connection.
I'll take care of this.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.000
THE DUNGEON OF BLACK COMPANY

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.340
My encounter with Kinji Ninomiya
was both sudden and shocking.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:53.460
Episode 11

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.180
He encouraged those in fear,

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:58.390
stood by those who were concerned,

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:02.020
and raised the morale of all the troops

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:05.810
as he built up plans for
moving deeper into the ruins.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.770
Crush!

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.030
Ninomiya...

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:20.740
Why are you going so
far out of your way to help us?

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.910
It's not for you.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.380
It's for our friend, who's still in pain.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.340
Friend...

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:34.590
Perhaps I was too lost in
my devotion to Lady Belza

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.090
and was failing to see everything else.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.850
I see...

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.810
It's people like him
who are truly fit to lead.

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.570
We're ready! We have one goal!

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:02.870
To destroy the ruins that are
mass-producing those Guardians!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:03.830
Alus!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.790
Wh-What?

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:09.670
Sorry about before.
I shouldn't have hit you.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:14.340
Let me see, I hope I didn't leave a scar.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:23.850
Don't touch me! I don't trust you yet.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.020
That's unfortunate.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.150
G-Gross...

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:34.780
What's the matter with Ninomiya?

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:39.320
Well, he's planning
more shenanigans, I'm sure...

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.700
Push forward!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.580
Follow my lead!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.540
From there, it was breathtaking.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.630
Raid squad, lure the
big ones off to the sides!

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:54.210
We'll spread their ranks out
and punch through to the ruins!

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.850
Right flank! Target the
monsters in front, fire at will!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:10.270
Muscle-brain squad! Focus on the enemies
in front of me and open up a path!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.440
Who are you calling muscle-brained?!

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.330
We're through! Go, Rim!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.410
Yeah!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:31.920
With all of my feelings,
I launch this super attack!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.290
Super punch!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.800
And super kick!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.640
We won.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.480
What a man.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:56.230
Those Guardians, that we were
completely unable to defeat,

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.110
were taken down so easily...

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:02.860
It's almost like I came all the way out
here to prove that I'm useless.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.320
You did it, Alus!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.790
I couldn't have done this
without your help.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:09.960
Thank you.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.040
N-Ninomiya...

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.080
Mr. Ninomiya!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:14.960
Yeah!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.170
I have a message from the fourth floor.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.840
Lady Sky's health
has improved and stabilized!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:24.510
Good news, Rim!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.890
Yeah!

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.430
Mr. Ninomiya!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.890
We found a door to the sixth floor!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.390
Right, I'm on my way!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:40.440
Sixth floor

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:44.320
That's the power Lady Belza seeks...

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.570
What a huge...

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:50.370
No, that power is unlike
anything I've felt before.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:54.000
You all stand back.
This thing is way too dangerous.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.670
I'll go and investigate by myself..

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.500
Wow...

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.710
He's approaching without any fear!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.260
How brave...!

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:08.010
Ninomiya! Ninomiya! Ninomiya!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.180
Oh, Ninomiya...

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.140
If only I had met you sooner...

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:17.020
Perhaps I would've been
able to lead a different life.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:24.950
Whoa! What's wrong, Ms. Shia?!

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:28.580
Look at Mr. Ninomiya volunteering
himself to go to the front lines

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:31.160
to protect the others...

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.250
I had so many doubts
about his personality,

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.250
but I hoped one day he'd become good...

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.580
Vindication!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.840
Hmm... Really...?

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.990
Thanks a bunch, everyone.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.910
Wh-What?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.120
Did he activate the artifact?!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.330
What are you thinking, Ninomiya?!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.540
Truth be told...

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.800
Before I went out to rescue you all,

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.170
I explored the fifth floor
and figured it out.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:33.640
There's no way we can survive a
head-on fight with that huge crowd...

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.520
Hmm? What's that?

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:42.940
It appears to be a "Management
Manipulator" built about 4,500 years ago.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.570
You know about these things?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:50.620
The Manipulator is most likely
the cause of the Guardian surge.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:55.120
If you can connect me to a device
with a higher command authority,

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:59.500
I should be able to allow you to freely
exercise a portion of the dungeon's power.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.210
I see...

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:03.960
Destiny is on my side!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:17.560
Behold! This massive influx of power!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:26.320
You all were useful pawns
in my pursuit of this power!

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:28.240
Wh-What?!

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:31.110
W-Was this what you
were planning all along?!

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.580
Indeed it was!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.460
Why are you doing this, Ninomiya?!

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.330
This is a bit much, even for you!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:47.710
I already told you, I can put the
power of the dungeon to good use!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.510
Original intention, executed!

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.300
I am loyal to my desires!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:59.180
That's right! I may lie to others,
but I never betray my own feelings!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.110
Watch...

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:15.330
This world shall be
rebuilt into a paradise!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:21.750
By me, commander-in-chief of the
Dungeon Black Company, Kinji Ninomiya!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.380
L-Lady Belza! Terrible news!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:36.550
Monsters are flowing out of
the dungeon and are headed this way!

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:37.430
What...

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.850
We have to run now!

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.730
There's no need to run!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:49.230
It's been a while, Dungeon Master Belza.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:54.450
Kinji Ninomiya... What is this?

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.990
What are those monsters...
No, it can't be!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:02.290
Indeed, I used the power of the
dungeon that you were seeking.

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:08.250
I knew it! The power of the ancient kings
really was buried in that dungeon!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:11.420
I can't believe
I let this insect steal it from me!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.380
So? What do you want?

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:17.760
Don't tell me you're so petty
you'd come all the way out here

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.970
to air out your grievances.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.020
Nah. I just wanted to hand you this.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:27.690
Letter of Resignation

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.900
Oh, almost forgot, this too.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.870
That settles my debt.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.370
Mr. Kinji Ninomiya.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:42.040
It appears that you now control
a great deal of power.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.830
But does that truly
provide security for your future?

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.880
If you quit now,
you will surely regret it. So...

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:55.010
You really shouldn't have treated
me like dirt! Your luck's run out!

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:58.180
Who's luck has run out?!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.970
"Letters of Resignation" must be turned
in at least 6 months in advance!

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:05.350
If you're incapable of maintaining
such a basic level of decency...

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.900
...I'll make sure you regret this!

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.190
My deepest apologies!

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:17.240
On the off chance that there's
a next time, I'll keep that in mind!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.910
Three months later

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.630
♬ Welcome, everyone,
to the kingdom of dreams ♬

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:36.260
♬ Ninomiya Dungeon Land ♬

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.510
♬ Everybody and everything ♬

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.220
♬ Everywhere you look ♬

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:43.850
♬ Ninomiya Dungeon Land ♬

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:44.680
♬ Ninomiya! ♬

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:45.680
♬ Himalaya! ♬

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.770
♬ Utsunomiya! ♬

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.600
♬ Kids are happy happy ♬

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.520
♬ Adults get lucky lucky ♬

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.360
--♬ Dead grandma starts dancing, too ♬
--Yay!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.150
♬ The place where dreams come true, ♬

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.450
♬ Ninomiya Dungeon Land ♬

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.580
"Ninomiya Dungeon Land," huh...?

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:06.080
Who would've thought of using
a dungeon to do something like this...?

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.910
Even if someone
could come up with the idea,

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.920
who would actually be able to pull it off?

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:12.290
So awesome... He truly is...

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.630
"The Man who Revolutionized
the Dungeons," right?

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.550
Oh, there you are, Ninomiya.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.550
Here.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:26.310
Last week's sales reports
and findings from the ant queen.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.980
Yes.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:33.690
Wow, business really is booming!

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:36.900
Obviously.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:40.160
But, Ninomiya, why are you doing this?

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:44.950
What the...? I already explained all
that to you when we built this place.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.580
Did you?

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:52.000
Ugh... Listen. This is the first step
towards remaking this world to my liking.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.800
I'm buying up abandoned dungeons
that have run out of magic power,

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.590
regenerating them,
and using that to fund our activities.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:02.800
Regeneration? You can do that?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.640
But why is it like, a playground?

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:12.350
Ranga, remember how your original
world was? The future of this planet.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.360
The reason why Belza was fighting
the Demon Lord and the monsters

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.030
was because she refused to control
and manage the dungeons.

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:22.410
She just dug up the
demonite until it ran out.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.080
That's where she failed.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.540
And, Ninomiya, you can do
this "control and manage" thing?

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:33.910
"Top Secret Dungeon Manual"

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:34.580
Yes, because I read this
operation manual for the dungeon.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:39.300
Belza didn't investigate it thoroughly
and only focused on the obvious perks.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.460
"Magic power circulation of the dungeon"

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:45.760
What is this? I can't read this at all.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.270
But I can.

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.390
I see.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:51.730
According to the manual,

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:57.730
"the dungeon becomes dormant when it
cannot draw magic power from the outside."

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.070
The outside?

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:01.320
In other words, those guys.

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:05.160
Ah, so the more adventurers visit...

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:08.030
...the more demonite we mine!

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.960
And our Dungeon Black Company
becomes more profitable!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.750
I see!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:18.590
An easy, fun, and safe
asset management system...

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:22.300
That is the true nature of this
Ninomiya Dungeon Land!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:25.340
Then we should lure in more bait!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:29.850
This quarter's profits are down
significantly compared to last year.

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.270
This is all because of
"Ninomiya Dungeon Land,"

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:36.060
that travesty, established by that fool.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:40.690
Currently, the effects are limited
to the Detmolt division of Raiza'ha,

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.990
but we may soon see a price crash
in the demonite market!

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:50.790
This Kinji Ninomiya character,
he has to be employing illegal means.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:54.030
Dungeon Master Raahan, 
Hilyorde Branch

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.960
He's just a nobody with no connections.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:57.750
The best response would be
to make good use of him.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:15:01.000
Dungeon Master Shutou,
 Guriano Branch

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.920
I'm sure he'll ruin himself soon.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.010
What are you talking about, you fools?!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:09.220
Dungeon Master Gou'un, 
Kogetsu Branch

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:09.140
I'll beat him into submission myself.
Bring him to me!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:17.940
Here I am, Ninomiya at your service!
No invitation required.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:18.940
What?!

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:23.440
Let's go ahead and
cancel your pointless meeting,

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:28.450
and discuss how you'll become
part of my Dungeon Black Company!

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:34.120
Us, become part of your company?
Is that supposed to be a joke?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.040
You think I came all the way out
here just to crack a joke?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.130
If so, you're way too optimistic!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:45.720
You can act tough,
but you're merely a single person.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:48.890
Don't underestimate
the power of the organization.

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:55.480
I'll crush you, smash you, and grind grind
grind grind grind grind you into a pulp.

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:57.520
Oh, so scary.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.900
Let's see how long you can keep that up.

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:05.610
I'll enjoy the looks on your faces
when you finally realize you've lost.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.450
How insolent!

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:08.570
Indeed!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.450
You'll regret that!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.530
A few days later

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.660
The demonite market is crashing?!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:20.580
The market is flooded
with high-quality demonite!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.250
Someone is flooding the market
with cheap goods, ignoring the cartel!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:28.170
It's all coming from locations
under Ninomiya's influence!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:35.560
Raiza'ha was really mistreating its
distribution and sales subcontractors.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:38.810
Getting them to join us was quite easy.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.270
Our market share is already
above 50% and growing steadily.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:51.360
Good work. It won't be long before
I control the entire demonite market.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.620
Then the next step is...

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:57.700
What's going on?!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.710
Why are there no customers?!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.590
Well... A company named
"Ninomiya Delivery Service"

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:07.840
has begun same-day delivery
of goods ordered from a catalog...

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:13.180
It seems all of our customers
have left to use that service...

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:16.560
Oh! That's them!

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.850
What's that...?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:26.860
Develop privately branded goods
based on cheaply mined demonite...

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:28.900
Items arrived, numbers 3 to 6!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:32.320
Westward-bound packages,
sending via teleportation.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.700
Use the teleportation
devices in the dungeons

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.200
to transport goods to different regions,

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.240
then deliver them using monsters!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:43.080
Is this how dungeons
are supposed to be used?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:47.840
At any rate, Cindy's Shop has
become quite a big company...

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.130
All thanks to Mr. Ninomiya!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.930
Enough is enough!

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:56.470
He took over 40% of the market share of
magical devices in such a short period?!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.180
Well...

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.730
First, we must win back the sales numbers.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.890
Ignore the quality of goods for now.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:06.730
I'm sure they're using poorly built goods
to prop up their numbers, too.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:09.280
Well, actually...

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:11.150
Well done, Wanibe.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.200
Thanks to your demonite research,

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:17.240
I can deliver safe and high-quality
goods to our consumers.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.200
This might sound terrible, but...

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.660
I never thought you'd
care about quality, Ninomiya.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:27.590
It was never my intention to beat
the market with sheer demonite volume.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:31.210
Reformation must be done from the core.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.760
Are you sure you're all right, though?

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:37.600
I did kind of force you to follow me.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:39.350
That's the last thing I expected to hear

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.890
from the person
who tricked me into joining...

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.600
But it's all right. I felt I could
accomplish something with you.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.610
That's why I left Raiza'ha.

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:51.900
She, on the other hand,
stubbornly refused to leave Raiza'ha.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:55.740
It's unfortunate, but after all, that is
part of what makes her a good person.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:02.500
You seem to be doing well, Mr. Ninomiya.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.250
I will also follow the path I believe in.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.540
Listen, fellow monsters!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.960
I will repeat this as
many times as needed!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.220
The era of human exploration
of the dungeons is over!

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:18.760
From this day on, humans must
live hand in hand with monsters!

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:25.520
That is the new era, the new business
model of the Dungeon Black Company!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:30.110
You will no longer be
simply hunted by adventurers.

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:34.570
Instead, you might even be
able to feed on them instead!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.240
Work, everyone!

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:41.280
You are the foundation on which
the future of this world will be built on!

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.790
Good...

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.500
Dance! Work! In the palm of my hand!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:59.720
And deliver to me the life of
eternal stability that I desire!

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:10.020
Unbelievable! The pillars
of our company's business...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:15.490
Exploration, gathering,
transportation, sales, and research...

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:20.490
We've lost in every way!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.910
Surprising, huh?

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:28.620
Even my boss wants to team up
with Ninomiya to start a new business.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:33.710
"I was awe-struck by that rotten brat's
techniques and ideology!" Or something.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.050
I don't want to hear that!

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:43.180
I'm going home.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:48.350
Huh? Hey, wait!

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:53.770
Kinji Ninomiya, that cursed fool...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:58.570
That power was supposed to be mine!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:03.950
Dammit! Dammit! Dammit!

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:07.000
You should give up, dear ancestor.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.330
Huh?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.000
You'll never get the power of the dungeon.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.050
You've completely lost to Ninomiya.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:18.840
What are you?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.680
Born as the illegitimate child
of the noble Shuba'ha family,

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:27.430
loved by no one, you had no choice
but to do everything by yourself.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:33.060
What? What nonsense
are you blabbing on about?

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:37.610
So you never trust anyone.
You never love anyone.

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:42.160
All you can do is deny,
reject, and break everything.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:46.410
Those broken by you,
in turn, grow to hate you.

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:51.330
I have no idea who you are, but...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:56.090
Stop talking about me like you know me!

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:05.350
Whoa, is this sort of like
a final inning home run upset?

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:16.150
You know what? I was able to change,
by meeting Ninomiya in a distant future.

00:22:16.150 --> 00:22:20.400
Dear ancestor... Belza.
Maybe you should change, too.

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:26.030
What... What right do you have to...

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:28.700
Belza, you got owned!

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:38.250
Ouch...

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:52.680
I just thought of something wonderful!
